@startuml Manager Manage Promotion
title Sequence Diagram: Quản lý Khuyến mãi & Promotion Engine (Task 6)
skinparam theme cerulean

actor Manager
boundary "manage-promotions.html" as UI
control "PromotionController" as Ctrl
entity "PromotionService" as Svc
entity "PromotionBuilder" as Builder
database "Database" as DB

== Tạo chương trình khuyến mãi mới ==
Manager -> UI: Nhập thông tin (nhiều trường tùy chọn)
UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/promotions (PromotionRequest)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: createPromotion(request)
activate Svc

Svc -> Builder: start building from request
Builder -> Builder: set mandatory fields (code, value)
Builder -> Builder: set optional fields (minOrder, maxDiscount, expiry)
Builder --> Svc: Promotion Entity

Svc -> DB: save(promotion)
Svc --> Ctrl: PromotionResponse
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: 201 Created
deactivate Ctrl

== Kiểm tra hiệu lực mã (Dành cho Booking) ==
[-> Svc: validatePromotion(code, orderAmount)
activate Svc
Svc -> DB: findByCode(code)
DB --> Svc: Promotion
Svc -> Svc: Check isActive, expiryDate, usageLimit
Svc -> Svc: Check minOrderAmount
alt Hợp lệ
    Svc --> [ : Promotion Details (Discount value)
else Không hợp lệ
    Svc --> [ : throw AppException("Mã không hợp lệ hoặc đã hết hạn")
end
deactivate Svc

@enduml
